  "notes": "## 0.19.0-alpha.5 - 2026-07-18\n\n### Features\n\n- Add Brazilian Portuguese throughout the app, including the tray menu (#1381)\n- Make first-time setup clearer and let users connect another device directly after creating their space (#1387)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Make received folders appear only when complete, preserve existing same-named items, and keep folder sync working across more storage locations (#1382)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.19.0-alpha.5 - 2026-07-18\n\n### Features\n\n- 新增覆盖整个应用及托盘菜单的巴西葡萄牙语支持 (#1381)\n- 优化首次设置引导，并支持在创建空间后直接连接另一台设备 (#1387)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 接收文件夹时仅在内容完整后显示，避免覆盖同名内容，并支持在更多存储位置正常同步文件夹 (#1382)",
